    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d599">

                <pb facs="0591" n="1325" xml:id="pg1325"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi> (<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Pera</hi>)</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1895-10-16"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                    1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>At Akhissar fifty Armenians killed 9tli instant. Massacre Trebi-zond last week;
                    over five hundred killed. Hunter and Chilton, now there, telegraph safe.
                    Situation here still precarious. British fleet is still at Lemno.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
